w?</td> <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #555;background-color:#fff8dc;color:#000">If you've completed the rollover requirements, exit the game completely and allow the system time to update your progress. Once the rollover progress bar is full, withdrawals will be available.</td> </tr> 
